# Actual Budget Docker Environment Variables

# Web UI Port
ACTUAL_PORT=5006

# Architecture Notes
# ==================
# Actual Budget uses a "local-first" architecture:
# - The server acts as a sync relay, not the source of truth
# - Your budget data lives on your devices
# - Server syncs changes between devices
# - Works offline; syncs when reconnected
#
# This design ensures:
# - Fast performance (no network latency for operations)
# - Privacy (data primarily on your devices)
# - Resilience (works without server access)

# First Run
# =========
# 1. Access http://localhost:5006
# 2. Create a new budget file (or import from YNAB)
# 3. Set up accounts and categories
# 4. Start tracking transactions
